{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o061a","title":"李丰张缉谋以夏侯玄为大将军事觉被诛","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o061a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"李丰张缉谋以夏侯玄为大将军事觉被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o061a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"诏原齐长公主三子免死李丰夏侯玄等夷族","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯玄临斩东市自若年四十六","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103b-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-a-o108-review-xuan","label":"陈寿评","text":"陈寿称夏侯玄格量名望，也批其未匡曹爽之非、援致良才。","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o108-review-xuan"]},{"id":"rensu-a-401d302f435ba5950969","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"李恢死后，李丰为中书令，父子兄弟皆诛","evidence":["rensu-q-fbfc1f3607c397ecf600"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0062","role":"谋易大臣","evidence":["shaodi-e-o061a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0063","role":"参与谋议","evidence":["shaodi-e-o061a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0064","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103a-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0104","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103a-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0105","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103a-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0106","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o103a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":254,"label":"二月庚戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y254","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o059","basis":"二月庚戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o061a-q","shaodi-q-o059","shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o061a-q","source_order":[4,269,"O061a"],"order":1111}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0062","name":"李丰","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0063","name":"张缉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0064","name":"夏侯玄","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0104","name":"苏铄","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0105","name":"乐敦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0106","name":"刘贤","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-fbfc1f3607c397ecf600","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-cdb3941cc1c8d62840c3","layer":"pei","quote":"恢死后，丰为中书令，父子兄弟皆诛","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-587a2f820f67ec03079c","start":127,"end":143},{"id":"shaodi-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-72d2bf4b63ebe87fddd6","layer":"original","quote":"庚戌〖12〗，中书令李丰与皇后父光禄大夫张缉等谋废易大臣〖13〗，以太常夏侯玄为大将军〖14〗。事觉，诸所连及者皆伏诛。辛亥〖15〗，大赦。三月，废皇后张氏。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：嘉平六年（公元 254）。己丑：旧历初一日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-386affd091adab4ef2df","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"shaodi-q-o059","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83849af55ebd17291970","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，己丑〖1〗，镇东将军毌丘俭上言：“昔诸葛恪围合肥新城，城中遣士刘整出围〖2〗，传消息，为贼所得。考问所传，语整曰：‘诸葛公欲活汝，汝可具服〖3〗。’整骂曰：‘死狗，此何言也！我当必死为魏国鬼！不苟求活逐汝去也。欲杀我者，便速杀之！’终无他辞。又遣士郑像出城传消息。或以语恪，恪遣马骑寻围迹索，得像还。四五人的头面缚〖4〗，将绕城表。敕语像〖5〗，使大呼，言：‘大军已还洛，不如早降！’像不从其言，更大呼城中曰：‘大军近在围外，壮士努力！’贼以刀筑其口，使不得言。像遂大呼，令城中闻知。整、像为兵，能守义执节，子弟宜有差异〖6〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-81b2bba6833a95ef3701","layer":"original","quote":"诏书：“齐长公主先帝遗爱〖20〗，原其三子死命。”于是丰、玄、缉、 〔铄〕 、敦、贤等，皆夷三族；﹝五﹞其余，亲属徙乐浪郡。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-81b2bba6833a95ef3701","layer":"original","quote":"玄格量弘济〖21〗，临斩东市〖22〗，颜色不变，举动自若。时年四十六。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":62,"end":97},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o108-review-xuan","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e8aa83f31b75ca2487ba","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：夏侯、曹氏，世为婚姻。故惇、渊、仁、洪、休、尚、真等，并以亲旧肺腑〖1〗，贵重于时；左右勋业〖2〗，咸有效劳〖3〗。爽德薄位尊，沉溺盈溢〖4〗；此固大《易》所著〖5〗，道家所忌也〖6〗。玄以规格局度〖7〗，世称其名；然与曹爽中外缱绻〖8〗，荣位如斯；曾未闻匡弼其非，援致良才。举兹以论，焉能免之乎〖9〗？","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":643,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
